; A shed load blocking the street. Same pickable arrangement as the other incidents --
; layer 8, solid to nothing -- with one deliberate exception: the Blocker child is a real
; collider on layer 1, a squat square slab across the carriageway, because a street only
; reads as shut if a vehicle actually stalls against something. It is square on purpose
; so the same scene shuts a north-south or an east-west street. The visual cargo is
; scattered by Debris.gd at runtime; the boxes themselves are collision-stripped as
; usual.

